# Code owners of 49GAION (hub). Documentation of who decides each path: the governing seat
# (GOV) of 49GAION. Required code-owner review is not switched on, because the account that
# opens pull requests is the account GOV merges with. The gate on main is GOV's merge of a
# pull request whose required checks are green, with no bypass actors on the main-protection
# ruleset. The checks that guard GOV's decisions are dr-frozen (a record never changes),
# signature-types-floor (a type leaves the Human Floor list only by a record of GOV that names
# it) and no-removal (the Human Floor's own sentences stay in the body) (DR-0052).
